WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:0
Old Maid: 53 cards with one joker; pairs are
discarded automatically. Do not keep the joker.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:17.000 line:0
North clicks one of East’s card backs
to draw; the face is unseen beforehand.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.999 line:0
Fast-forward: each player draws from the next;
matching pairs are discarded automatically.

00:00:22.999 --> 00:00:31.999 line:0
North draws a J, which pairs with the J in hand
and is discarded; any suits pair.

00:00:31.999 --> 00:00:41.999 line:0
Fast-forward: players with empty hands leave;
the rest keep drawing.

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:56.999 line:0
Fast-forward: two more deals follow. Finishing
order scores 3, 2, 1, 0; scores add up.

00:00:56.999 --> 00:01:06.000 line:0
South wins with 7 points total;
East and West have 4 each, North has 3.
